<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1825903525"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1549361614"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="where you are"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="魔王魂 / 森田交一"/><amll:meta key="album" value="where you are"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="07:40.350"><div begin="00:33.937" end="07:40.350"><p begin="00:33.937" end="00:39.063" itunes:key="L1">煌めく星達が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">璀璨群星</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ra me ku ho shi ta chi ga</span></p><p begin="00:39.064" end="00:44.364" itunes:key="L2">蒼く空を染めてゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将苍穹渐渐浸染</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a o ku so ra wo so me te yu ku</span></p><p begin="00:44.365" end="00:49.644" itunes:key="L3">月夜に浮かんでる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">月夜下浮现的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu ki yo ni u ka n de ru</span></p><p begin="00:49.645" end="00:54.974" itunes:key="L4">花は今も揺らめいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">花朵此刻仍在摇曳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na ha i ma mo yu ra me i te</span></p><p begin="00:55.262" end="01:00.320" itunes:key="L5">遠い日の約束<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">昔日遥远的约定</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to o i hi no ya ku so ku</span></p><p begin="01:00.321" end="01:05.717" itunes:key="L6">僕は今も覚えてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我至今仍铭记于心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ha i ma mo o bo e te ru</span></p><p begin="01:05.718" end="01:11.411" itunes:key="L7">あの頃の僕らは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那时的我们</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no ko ro no bo ku ra ha</span></p><p begin="01:11.412" end="01:15.929" itunes:key="L8">まだ何も知らずに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还懵懂一无所知</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da na ni mo shi ra zu ni</span></p><p begin="01:16.178" end="01:21.650" itunes:key="L9">「もう行かなくちゃ」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">「必须出发了」</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 mo u i ka na ku cha 」</span></p><p begin="01:21.651" end="01:27.452" itunes:key="L10">笑いながら泣いてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">笑着却流下泪水</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ra i na ga ra na i te ru</span></p><p begin="01:27.453" end="01:32.873" itunes:key="L11">繋いだ手が儚く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紧握的手如泡影般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu na i da te ga ha ka na ku</span></p><p begin="01:32.874" end="01:37.934" itunes:key="L12">夢に溶けてゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">消融于梦境中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me ni to ke te yu ku</span></p><p begin="01:38.276" end="01:43.539" itunes:key="L13">君に届きますように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿歌声能传到你身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ni to do ki ma su yo u ni</span></p><p begin="01:43.540" end="01:48.592" itunes:key="L14">唄い続けてるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会永远歌唱下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ta i tsu du ke te ru yo</span></p><p begin="01:48.593" end="01:54.439" itunes:key="L15">また逢えると信じてるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只因坚信终将重逢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta a e ru to shi n ji te ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:54.440" end="01:59.497" itunes:key="L16">歩き続けるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会继续前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ru ki tsu du ke ru yo</span></p><p begin="01:59.498" end="02:05.059" itunes:key="L17">君に届きますように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿祈愿能抵达你心间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ni to do ki ma su yo u ni</span></p><p begin="02:05.060" end="02:10.333" itunes:key="L18">祈り続けてるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会永远祈祷下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i no ri tsu du ke te ru yo</span></p><p begin="02:10.334" end="02:16.222" itunes:key="L19">僕の時間続くといいな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿我的时光能持续下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku no ji ka n tsu du ku to i i na</span></p><p begin="02:16.223" end="02:24.925" itunes:key="L20">君の中で永遠に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在你心中化为永恒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no na ka de e i e n ni</span></p><p begin="03:07.294" end="03:12.639" itunes:key="L21">眩しいあの季節<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">耀眼的那段季节</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma bu shi i a no ki se tsu</span></p><p begin="03:12.640" end="03:18.242" itunes:key="L22">いくつ通り過ぎただろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已流逝过多少回</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ku tsu to o ri su gi ta da ro u</span></p><p begin="03:18.243" end="03:23.600" itunes:key="L23">優しいあの笑顔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">温柔的那张笑颜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya sa shi i a no e ga o</span></p><p begin="03:23.601" end="03:28.730" itunes:key="L24">胸の中で光る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍在心底闪烁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ne no na ka de hi ka ru</span></p><p begin="03:28.959" end="03:34.392" itunes:key="L25">「もう大丈夫」と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">「已经没关系了」</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 mo u da i jo u bu 」 to</span></p><p begin="03:34.393" end="03:39.843" itunes:key="L26">優しい嘘をついた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">轻声说出善意的谎言</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya sa shi i u so wo tsu i ta</span></p><p begin="03:39.844" end="03:49.850" itunes:key="L27">星空はただ僕を照らしているだけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">星空只是默默照耀着我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho shi zo ra ha ta da bo ku wo te ra shi te i ru da ke</span></p><p begin="03:50.106" end="03:55.841" itunes:key="L28">君に届きますように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿思念能传到你身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ni to do ki ma su yo u ni</span></p><p begin="03:55.842" end="04:00.836" itunes:key="L29">手を振り続けるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会永远挥动双手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te wo fu ri tsu du ke ru yo</span></p><p begin="04:00.837" end="04:06.656" itunes:key="L30">また逢えると信じてるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只因坚信终将重逢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta a e ru to shi n ji te ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="04:06.657" end="04:11.567" itunes:key="L31">歩き続けるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会继续前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ru ki tsu du ke ru yo</span></p><p begin="04:11.568" end="04:17.285" itunes:key="L32">君に届きますように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿心意能抵达你心间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ni to do ki ma su yo u ni</span></p><p begin="04:17.286" end="04:22.550" itunes:key="L33">目を覚まさなくても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使不必再醒来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me wo sa ma sa na ku te mo</span></p><p begin="04:22.551" end="04:28.211" itunes:key="L34">君の時間続いてゆくよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的时光仍会延续下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no ji ka n tsu du i te yu ku yo</span></p><p begin="04:28.212" end="04:38.852" itunes:key="L35">僕の中で永遠に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在我心中化为永恒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku no na ka de e i e n ni</span></p><p begin="05:21.938" end="05:27.630" itunes:key="L36">君に届きますように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿歌声能传到你身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ni to do ki ma su yo u ni</span></p><p begin="05:27.631" end="05:32.447" itunes:key="L37">唄い続けてるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会永远歌唱下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ta i tsu du ke te ru yo</span></p><p begin="05:32.448" end="05:38.397" itunes:key="L38">また逢えると信じてるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只因坚信终将重逢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta a e ru to shi n ji te ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="05:38.398" end="05:43.409" itunes:key="L39">歩き続けるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会继续前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ru ki tsu du ke ru yo</span></p><p begin="05:43.410" end="05:48.959" itunes:key="L40">君に届きますように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿祈愿能抵达你心间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ni to do ki ma su yo u ni</span></p><p begin="05:48.960" end="05:54.218" itunes:key="L41">祈り続けてるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会永远祈祷下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i no ri tsu du ke te ru yo</span></p><p begin="05:54.219" end="05:59.982" itunes:key="L42">僕の時間続くといいな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿我的时光能持续下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku no ji ka n tsu du ku to i i na</span></p><p begin="05:59.983" end="06:09.831" itunes:key="L43">My feeling, where you are 永遠に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的思念就在你所在之处 直到永远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">My feeling where you are e i e n ni</span></p><p begin="06:09.832" end="07:40.350" itunes:key="L44">La la la …<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">La la la</span></p></div></body></tt>